      "provenance": {
        "notes": "Watering: RHS says evenly damp with only the top layer allowed to dry a little; NC State only tags it drought intolerant, which fits. The ASPCA page mentions that a bite may cause slight stomach upset; not graded (non-toxic). Temperature is a minimum (RHS: at or above 12 C). Size: NC State 1 to 2 ft by 9 to 12 in, RHS about 30 cm tall. Humidity is moderate to high on RHS but without numbers."
      },
